outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-pause h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></button></div></div></header><nav aria-label=\"五幕主页导航\" data-cstd-theme-scene-rail=\"atelier\" class=\"cstd-theme-scene-rail pointer-events-auto z-[34]\"><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"hero\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"true\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-current=\"location\" aria-label=\"01 / 信号\"><span>01</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">开始</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">入侵</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">门庭</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">启程</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"systems\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#systems\" aria-label=\"02 / 系统\"><span>02</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">方法</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">装载</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">锻造</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">法术书</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"proof\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#proof\" aria-label=\"03 / 证据\"><span>03</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">作品</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">追踪</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">试炼</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">判定</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"path\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#path\" aria-label=\"04 / 知识\"><span>04</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">笔记</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">记忆</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">神谕</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">编年史</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"finale\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#cstd-footer\" aria-label=\"05 / 联络\"><span>05</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">联络</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">撤离</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">归返</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">传承</span></b></a></div></nav><div data-cstd-home-atelier=\"true\" class=\"relative z-10 bg-[#f5f5f7] text-[#1d1d1f]\"><section id=\"top\" data-cstd-scene=\"hero\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"hero\" class=\"relative flex min-h-[92svh] flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden px-6 pb-16 pt-32 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(58%_46%_at_72%_30%,rgb(255_255_255/92%),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/50\"></span>CSTD / 个人工作室 · 墨尔本</p><h1 class=\"mt-7 text-[3.4rem] font-bold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-[5.6rem] lg:text-[7rem]\">奶黄包</h1><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-2xl\">数据科学研究生 · 把分析、数据系统和产品一起交付的人</p><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#55555c] md:text-lg md:leading-9\">我在莫纳什读数据科学硕士；本科在悉尼大学从化学与生物分子工程转入数据科学。不管是在 R 里清洗 147 万行开放数据，还是把分析做成能上线的产品，我的工作方式都一样：问题是真实的，数据是可核验的，结论能复算，产品能交付。这个站不是技能清单，放的是作品、取舍，以及它们后来怎么被验证。</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1d1d1f] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03]\" href=\"#work\">查看作品<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1d1d1f]/25 px-6 text-sm font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] transition-colors hover:border-[#1d1d1f]/60\" href=\"/about\">认识我<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-8 mx-auto flex w-fit items-center gap-2 text-[#6e6e73]\"><span class=\"h-8 w-px animate-pulse bg-[#1d1d1f]/30\"></span></div></section><section aria-label=\"关键数字\" class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-2 gap-y-8 px-6 py-12 md:grid-cols-4 md:px-10\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">7</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">已发布案例</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">81</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">项公开证据</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">8</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">篇技术札记</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:180ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">100</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">内容健康度</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"method\" data-cstd-scene=\"systems\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"method\" class=\"border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->01<!-- --> / <!-- -->工作方式</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">三步，把一件事做完</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-atelier-method !border-x-0 !border-t-0\"><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner !w-full !max-w-none !px-0\"><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" data-cstd-atelier-method=\"deconstruct\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"工作方式三步\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method-steps\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"deconstruct\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"true\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span><strong>拆解</strong><small>先对齐事实，再谈方案</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"build\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">02</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg></span><strong>构建</strong><small></small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"verify\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">03</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><strong>验证</strong><small></small></button></div><div class=\"cstd-atelier-method-detail\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>把问题拆成可验证的小问题：数据在哪、口径是什么、约束有哪些。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"work\" data-cstd-scene=\"proof\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"work\" class=\"bg-white px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->02<!-- --> / <!-- -->精选作品</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">把分析、系统与产品，做成可核验的作品。</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"md:col-span-2\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"墨尔本 CBD 行人活动的星期×小时热力图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->开放数据分析 / 可复现 R 管线</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">墨尔本行人 × 微气候</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">把墨尔本 CBD 三个官方开放数据源清洗、空间连接并建模成一条可复现的分析管线：147 万行行人记录，在 150 米匹配规则下遇见微气候。</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:70ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/work/rocodex-platform\"><img alt=\"RocoDex 图鉴产品界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 36%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/rocodex.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->领域边界 / 内容产品</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">RocoDex 双站平台</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">个人主站和 RocoDex 共用一个 Next.js 部署，但域名、认证、内容模块和回归测试各自负责，互不越界。</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:140ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha 公司研究界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->证据管线 / 决策工作台</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Alpha 研究系统</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#0066cc] transition-colors hover:text-[#1d1d1f]\" href=\"/work\">进入作品档案<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section data-cstd-atelier-section=\"data\" class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->数据分析 / 开放数据</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-[2.6rem]\">147 万行开放数据，一条可重跑的分析管线。</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-[#55555c]\">把墨尔本 CBD 的行人计数、传感器位置与微气候三份官方数据清洗、空间连接并建模：温度、PM2.5 与风在控制城市节奏后仍与活动相关，脆弱性在不同地段、工作日与周末并不相同。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1d1d1f] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03]\" href=\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\">阅读完整分析<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">R · data.table · ggplot2 · lm</span></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:100ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[24rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgb(0_0_0/4%),0_24px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/10%)] md:h-[28rem]\" href=\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"墨尔本 CBD 行人活动的星期×小时热力图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 rounded-full bg-white/92 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#1d1d1f]\">星期 × 小时活动热力图</span></a></div></div></section><section id=\"notes\" data-cstd-scene=\"path\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"notes\" class=\"bg-white px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->03<!-- --> / <!-- -->技术札记</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">把判断写下来，让它们可查。</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-[#1d1d1f]/10\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">一个 Next.js 部署，两个真正独立的网站</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">一个仓库、一次部署，如何让 custard.top 和 RocoDex 仍然像两套真正独立的产品。</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">先刷新证据，再让模型说话</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">公司研究最贵的往往不是 token，而是过期事实、重复任务和说不清来路的结论。</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">AI 放在解释层，公式留在决策层</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">让 AI 帮忙整理和解释，但把估值公式、现金流、折现和版本决定权留给能测试的代码。</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#0066cc] transition-colors hover:text-[#1d1d1f]\" href=\"/notes\">进入技术札记<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1200px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->可执行实验</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.018em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-3xl\">结论不靠口头，靠可以重跑的实验。</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1d1d1f]/25 px-6 text-sm font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] transition-colors hover:border-[#1d1d1f]/60\" href=\"/lab\">进入实验室<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" data-cstd-scene=\"finale\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"contact\" class=\"bg-white px-6 pb-28 pt-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->04<!-- --> / <!-- -->开放联络</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">如果你在找一个会把分析做成产品的人。</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/about\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">关于我<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">工程路径、工作原则与能力面。</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/now\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">现在<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">此刻正在构建与学习的内容。</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/resume\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">技术履历<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">机器可读与可打印的完整履历。</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:140ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"mt-14 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#6e6e73]\">这个站本身就是最完整的作品：双语内容管线、可复现分析、四套主题与自动化验证，全部在这一个 Next.js 部署里。</p></div></div></section></div><div data-cstd-home-game=\"true\" class=\"contents\"><section id=\"top\" data-cstd-hero=\"true\" data-cstd-chapter=\"hero\" data-cstd-scene=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-hero-title\" class=\"cstd-hero-stage relative z-10 flex min-h-svh items-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 px-5 pb-14 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:min-h-[104svh] lg:px-16 lg:pb-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-stage-visual=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"cstd-stage-visual-image absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-stage-visual-wash=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-stage-visual-focus=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\"></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"ambient\" class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[74%] bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98),rgba(5,7,9,0.84)_60%,transparent)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40 bg-[linear-gradient(0deg,#050709,transparent)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"narrative\" class=\"cstd-hero-scanline absolute inset-x-0 top-[24%] h-px bg-[#24e0ff]/35\"></div><div data-cstd-hero-layout=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(19rem,25rem)] lg:items-end lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"cstd-hero-copy max-w-[50rem]\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"narrative\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] md:text-xs\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#f4d431]\"></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">CSTD / 个人工作室</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">CSTD / PERSONAL STUDIO</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">冥府档案 / 造物者 017</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">星界旅记 / 冒险者 017</span></p><h1 id=\"cstd-hero-title\" aria-label=\"奶黄包\" data-text=\"奶黄包\" class=\"cstd-hero-wordmark mt-7 w-fit text-[4.35rem] font-black leading-[0.86] text-[#f2efe7] md:text-[6.5rem] lg:text-[7.75rem]\">奶黄包</h1><p data-cstd-hero-role=\"true\" class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm font-black leading-tight text-[#24e0ff] md:text-lg\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">数据科学研究生 · 分析、系统与产品</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">DATA SCIENCE POSTGRADUATE / ANALYSIS THAT SHIPS</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">数据科学研究生 / 分析铸造者</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">数据科学研究生 / 分析策士</span></p><p data-cstd-hero-thesis=\"true\" data-cstd-narrative-thesis=\"我更关心东西能不能在真实环境里跑起来。\" class=\"mt-10 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] text-[#f2efe7] md:text-[2.8rem] lg:text-[3.1rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">把问题拆开、<span class=\"block\">把答案做实。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">我把问题拆开，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">直到它能在现实里运行。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">困难的系统，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">要经得住一次次归返。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">复杂系统，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">也是一场由选择写成的冒险。</span></span></p><p data-cstd-hero-description=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#aeb8bb] md:text-lg md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">我用 R、Python 和 SQL 做可复现的分析，也把分析做成能上线的产品。这个站是作品、取舍与验证过程的完整记录。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">我做分析，也做分析背后的系统。数据、界面、AI 和发布都要经得住真实使用，而不是只在演示里好看。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">我把分析、AI、数据和发布放进同一座工坊：先锻出形，再过试炼，最后带着证据回到现实。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">我把问题、数据、代码和发布摊开在同一张冒险桌上：看清局势，组成工具，做出选择，再带着证据继续前进。</span></p><div data-cstd-hero-actions=\"true\" class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3\"><a href=\"#systems\" class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 bg-[#f4d431] px-5 font-mono text-sm font-black text-[#050709] [clip-path:polygon(0_0,100%_0,100%_70%,calc(100%-14px)_100%,0_100%)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\">进入系统现场<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#24e0ff]/55 px-1 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#c9f8ff] transition-colors hover:border-white hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\" href=\"/about\">认识奶黄包<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-motion-layer=\"interactive\" class=\"lg:pb-1\"><aside data-cstd-entry-console=\"true\" data-cstd-entry-ready=\"false\" aria-label=\"主页浏览深度\"><div data-cstd-entry-status=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">STUDIO LINK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">STUDIO LINK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">踏入工坊</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">打开冒险日志</span></p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[9px] font-black\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>正在建立现场</span></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-boot-track=\"true\" class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"identity\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"systems\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"proof\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span></div><span class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"选择浏览深度\" data-cstd-depth-tabs=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-3\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-signal\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"true\">10 SEC</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-tour\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"false\">1 MIN</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-archive\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"false\">5 MIN</button></div><div id=\"cstd-depth-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-depth-signal\" data-cstd-depth-panel=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 min-h-36\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->10 SEC</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold leading-tight\">先看结果</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6\">三项代表作、明确职责和可核验的线上入口。</p><a href=\"#proof\" data-cstd-depth-action=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\">直达作品与证据<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></a></div></aside></div><dl data-cstd-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"grid max-w-[46rem] border-t border-white/14 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">01</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">数据分析</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">02</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">数据系统与产品</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">03</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">发布与验证</dd></div></dl></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 hidden items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#697478] md:flex lg:right-16\"><span class=\"h-px w-14 bg-[#24e0ff]/55\"></span>下一章 / 02 能力系统</div></section><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" data-cstd-atelier-method=\"deconstruct\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"工作方式三步\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method-steps\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"deconstruct\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"true\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span><strong>拆解</strong><small>先对齐事实，再谈方案</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"build\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">02</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg></span><strong>构建</strong><small></small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"verify\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">03</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><strong>验证</strong><small></small></button></div><div class=\"cstd-atelier-method-detail\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>把问题拆成可验证的小问题：数据在哪、口径是什么、约束有哪些。</p></div></div><section data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"neon-district\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-neon-breach-title\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-neon-breach\"><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner\"><header class=\"cstd-neon-breach-header\"><div><p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg> CSTD://BREACH_SEQUENCE</p><h2 id=\"cstd-neon-breach-title\">接入我的工作方式。</h2></div><div data-cstd-neon-breach-status=\"scanning\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg><span>00 / 03</span></div></header><div class=\"cstd-neon-breach-line\" style=\"--cstd-breach-progress:0\"><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"1\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"active\"><span>01</span><strong>定位</strong><small>扫描真实问题</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"2\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"locked\" disabled=\"\"><span>02</span><strong>解密</strong><small>读出系统约束</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"3\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"locked\" disabled=\"\"><span>03</span><strong>接管</strong><small>交付可验证结果</small></button></div><footer class=\"cstd-neon-breach-footer\"><span>依次击穿三个节点</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"重置入侵序列\" title=\"重置\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg></button></footer></div></section><section data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"underworld-forge\" data-cstd-boon-selected=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-underworld-boon-title\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-underworld-boon\"><div class=\"cstd-underworld-slash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner\"><header class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-header\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg></span><div><p>冥河之前 / 选择一项神赐</p><h2 id=\"cstd-underworld-boon-title\">每次交付，都从一种意志开始。</h2></div></header><div class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-grid\"><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-underworld-boon=\"edge\" data-cstd-underworld-boon-active=\"false\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-sigil\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\