proach=\"lore\" data-cstd-astral-approach-active=\"false\"><span>学识</span><strong>+<!-- -->4</strong><small>用研究缩短弯路</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-cstd-astral-approach=\"party\" data-cstd-astral-approach-active=\"false\"><span>协作</span><strong>+<!-- -->3</strong><small>让不同专长同行</small></button></div><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-astral-roll=\"true\" aria-label=\"掷二十面骰\" class=\"cstd-astral-d20-button\"><span class=\"cstd-astral-d20-face\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dices\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"10\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m17.92 14 3.5-3.5a2.24 2.24 0 0 0 0-3l-5-4.92a2.24 2.24 0 0 0-3 0L10 6\"></path><path d=\"M6 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h.01\"></path></svg><strong>D20</strong></span><small>掷骰</small></button><div data-cstd-astral-roll-result=\"true\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"cstd-astral-roll-result\"><span>旅记条目</span><strong>+2</strong><p>先选择专长，再让骰子回答。</p></div></div></div></section><div id=\"systems\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-scene-shell=\"systems\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-16 focus:outline-none\"><section data-cstd-chapter=\"systems\" data-cstd-scene=\"systems\" data-cstd-studio-twin=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"studio-twin-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 overflow-hidden border-y border-white/10 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><img alt=\"五个能力区域连接到奶黄包个人工作室核心\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[64%_50%] opacity-15\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-core-world-v4.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.99),rgba(5,7,9,0.93)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.8))]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">02 / CAPABILITY SYSTEM</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">02 / CAPABILITY SYSTEM</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">第二殿 / 铸造系统</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">第二章 / 队伍与法术书</span></p><h2 id=\"studio-twin-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">我不收集技能图标，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">我构建能上线的系统。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">我不收集技能图标，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">我构建能上线的系统。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">能力不是徽章，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">是反复淬炼的工具。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">能力不是技能栏，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">是队伍里真正能接住局面的本事。</span></span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#aeb8bb]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">产品、AI、数据和发布是同一件事的不同侧面。点开一个方向，看它在真实项目里承担了什么。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">产品、AI、数据和发布是同一件事的不同侧面。点开一个方向，看它在真实项目里承担了什么。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">五条能力链就是五套铸具。打开一套，看它如何塑形、承受试炼，又在哪个真实项目里留下锻痕。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">五条能力链像一支队伍：各自有专长，也必须在同一场冒险里互相接住。打开一条，看看它在哪个真实项目里改变了路线。</span></p></div><a data-cstd-observatory-deployment=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/Muguett-DBY/RocoDex/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"group flex min-w-56 items-center gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-4 font-mono transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff]/50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-commit-horizontal h-4 w-4 text-[#24e0ff]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"15\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg><span><span class=\"block text-[11px] font-black text-[#788489]\">LIVE / <!-- -->AGING</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm font-black text-white\">LOCAL</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right ml-auto h-4 w-4 text-[#788489] transition-colors group-hover:text-[#24e0ff]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></header><div data-cstd-system-explorer=\"true\" class=\"mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[19rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-12\"><div data-cstd-system-tabs=\"true\" class=\"border-t border-white/12\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"能力方向\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-system-tab-product-surfaces\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"cstd-system-detail\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-studio-district-option=\"product-surfaces\" data-cstd-system=\"product-surfaces\" data-cstd-system-active=\"true\" class=\"relative flex min-h-[4.75rem] w-full items-center gap-4 border-b border-white/12 px-1 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:ou