 border-b border-black/15 bg-[#f0efe9] px-5 py-20 text-[#090b0d] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#005f70]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">第三殿 / 已成之器</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">第三章 / 已走过的旅程</span></p><h2 id=\"proof-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">三个系统，<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">三条足够清楚的证据链。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">三个系统，<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">三条足够清楚的证据链。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">三件已成之器，<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">每件都带着试炼的刻痕。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">三段已经走过的旅程，<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">每一段都有选择与后果。</span></span></h2></div><p class=\"border-l border-black/20 pl-6 text-sm leading-7 text-[#465156] md:text-base md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">首页先给你看结果：什么做成了，为什么这样做，现在哪里能打开。完整拆解留给案例页。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">首页先给你看结果：什么做成了，为什么这样做，现在哪里能打开。完整拆解留给案例页。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">这里不陈列未经试炼的样品。每件作品只留下结果、关键取舍和仍可核验的锻造记录。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">这里不写注定胜利的英雄故事。每段旅程只留下当时的局势、真正做过的选择，以及现在仍能核验的结果。</span></p></header><div data-cstd-proof-grid=\"true\" class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:auto-rows-[15.5rem]\"><article data-cstd-proof=\"rocodex\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-7 lg:row-span-2 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"RocoDex 图鉴产品界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 36%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/rocodex.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.03)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.3)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_82%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->1<!-- --> / <!-- -->领域边界 / 内容产品</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->100<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl\">RocoDex 双站平台</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0]\">个人主站和 RocoDex 共用一个 Next.js 部署，但域名、认证、内容模块和回归测试各自负责，互不越界。</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-5\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/work/rocodex-platform\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://rocodex.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"打开 RocoDex 双站平台\" title=\"打开 RocoDex 双站平台\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article data-cstd-proof=\"crm\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-5 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"CFZZS 招商 CRM 仪表盘\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 26%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/crm.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.72)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.12)_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7 lg:right-auto lg:max-w-[75%]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->2<!-- --> / <!-- -->业务系统 / 权限与并发</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] hidden lg:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl\">CFZZS 招商 CRM</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0] lg:hidden\">给产业园区招商团队用的一套线索工作台：从企业查重、阶段推进到空间资源和导出，关键状态都能追溯。</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/work/cfzzs-crm\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://cfzzs.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"打开 CFZZS 招商 CRM\" title=\"打开 CFZZS 招商 CRM\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article data-cstd-proof=\"alpha\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-5 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha 公司研究界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.72)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.12)_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7 lg:right-auto lg:max-w-[75%]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->3<!-- --> / <!-- -->证据管线 / 决策工作台</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] hidden lg:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl\">CSTD Alpha 研究系统</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0] lg:hidden\">把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://alpha.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"打开 CSTD Alpha 研究系统\" title=\"打开 CSTD Alpha 研究系统\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article></div><section data-cstd-evidence-chain=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-chain-heading\" class=\"mt-14\"><header data-cstd-evidence-chain-header=\"true\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 6a9 9 0 0 0-9 9V3\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">TRACE / DECISION CHAIN</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">TRACE / DECISION CHAIN</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">试炼谱 / 因果与证据</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">冒险日志 / 选择与后果</span></p><h3 id=\"evidence-chain-heading\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold md:text-4xl\">别只看成品，沿着决定走一遍。</h3></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-6\">选择一个项目，再检查问题、取舍、系统和验证。每一段都来自对应案例与公开证据清单。</p></header><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"选择项目证据链\" data-cstd-evidence-project-tabs=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 grid md:grid-cols-3\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-rocodex\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"true\"><span>0<!-- -->1</span><strong>RocoDex 双站平台</strong><small>100<!-- -->% / <!-- -->7<!-- --> <!-- -->项证据</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-crm\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"false\"><span>0<!-- -->2</span><strong>CFZZS 招商 CRM</strong><small>80<!-- -->% / <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->项证据</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-alpha\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"false\"><span>0<!-- -->3</span><strong>CSTD Alpha 研究系统</strong><small>80<!-- -->% / <!-- -->5<!-- --> <!-- -->项证据</small></button></div><div id=\"evidence-chain-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-project-rocodex\" data-cstd-evidence-panel=\"true\" class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)]\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"选择证据阶段\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-tabs=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-rocodex-problem\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"true\"><span>01</span><strong>问题</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-rocodex-decision\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>02</span><strong>取舍</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-rocodex-system\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>03</span><strong>系统</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-rocodex-verification\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>04</span><strong>验证</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div><article id=\"evidence-phase-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-phase-rocodex-problem\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-panel=\"true\"><p data-cstd-evidence-signal=\"true\">边界不能只存在于目录名</p><h4>同一个容器，两个产品</h4><p>个人主站与图鉴共享 Next.js，却拥有完全不同的用户、路由和运行时。</p><div data-cstd-evidence-meta=\"true\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <!-- -->证据覆盖<!-- --> <!-- -->100<!-- -->%</span><span>最近核验<!-- --> <!-- -->2026-08-09</span></div><div data-cstd-evidence-actions=\"true\"><a href=\"/work/rocodex-platform\">读完整案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://rocodex.custard.top\">打开线上系统<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></article></div></section><div data-cstd-proof-footer=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t pt-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span>7<!-- --> <!-- -->个已发布案例<!-- --> / <!-- -->31<!-- --> <!-- -->项公开证据</span><div class=\"flex gap-6\"><a data-cstd-proof-footer-link=\"primary\" href=\"/work\">全部案例</a><a data-cstd-proof-footer-link=\"secondary\" href=\"/proof.json\">PROOF.JSON</a></div></div></div></section><section data-cstd-chapter=\"operator\" data-cstd-evidence-subchapter=\"true\" data-cstd-executable-evidence=\"true\" data-cstd-home-replay=\"alpha-race\" aria-labelledby=\"executable-evidence-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#050709] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><span id=\"operator\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-px w-px scroll-mt-20\"></span><div data-cstd-evidence-layout=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(25rem,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] xl:items-start xl:gap-16\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">03B / EXECUTABLE EVIDENCE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">03B / EXECUTABLE EVIDENCE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">试炼场 / 可执行证据</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">命运判定 / 可执行证据</span></p><h2 id=\"executable-evidence-heading\" class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl xl:text-[3.75rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">案例不只可读，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">还可以运行。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">案例不只可读，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">还可以运行。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">别把结果写成传说，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">运行才算证词。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">结果不能靠传闻，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">掷下骰子，亲自过一次判定。</span></span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-[#aeb7ba]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">不放一段录屏糊弄过去。这里把输入、计算和结果摊开，让你亲手触发一次边界。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">不放一段录屏糊弄过去。这里把输入、计算和结果摊开，让你亲手触发一次边界。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">每个系统都要进试炼场。改动条件、重新点火，看看哪条结论还能从熔炉里完整走出来。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">每个结论都要接受一次判定。改动条件、重新运行，看看成功究竟来自运气，还是来自系统本身。</span></p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-6\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\">查看完整技术案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#899499] hover:text-white\" href=\"/lab/proof-museum\">证据博物馆<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-case-replay=\"alpha-race\" data-cstd-worker=\"dedicated\" data-cstd-worker-ready=\"false\" class=\"border border-white/15 bg-[#07090b]/92 p-5 md:p-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg> <!-- -->DEDICATED WEB WORKER</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">异步版本竞态</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#aab3b6]\">旧任务可以完成，但不能覆盖新事实。</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 bg-[#f4d431] px-4 font-mono text-xs font-black text-black hover:bg-[#24e0ff] disabled:cursor-wait disabled:bg-[#485054] disabled:text-[#d7dfdc] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->运行重放</button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"重置\" title=\"重置\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#9aa4a8] hover:border-white hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg></button></div></div><label class=\"mt-7 block font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#7b878c]\" for=\"replay-alpha-race-input\">并发研究任务<!-- --> / <span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">4<!-- -->个</span></label><input id=\"replay-alpha-race-input\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-full accent-[#f4d431]\" value=\"4\"/><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-center gap-3 border-y border-white/10 py-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#9aa6aa]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg> INPUT READY / WORKER IDLE</div></div></div></section></div><div id=\"path\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-scene-shell=\"path\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-16 focus:outline-none\"><section data-cstd-chapter=\"path\" data-cstd-scene=\"path\" data-cstd-knowledge-lens=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"knowledge-lens-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><img alt=\"工程札记通过引用关系连接成知识网络\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[62%_50%] opacity-12\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-knowledge-loom-v3.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.99),rgba(5,7,9,0.94)_58%,rgba(5,7,9,0.82))]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain-circuit h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h8\"></path><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"3\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">04 / TECH NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">04 / TECH NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">神谕殿 / 技术札记</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">第四章 / 旅途编年史</span></p><h2 id=\"knowledge-lens-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">技术分享不堆术语，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">只讲做过的判断。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">技术分享不堆术语，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">只讲做过的判断。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">神谕不替人判断，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">只留下可追的线索。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">地图不会替你选择，<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">但会标出每条走过的路。</span></span></h2></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#aeb8bb] md:text-base md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">有问题就从问题开始。答案、依据和下一步都放在眼前，不把读者赶去猜我的上下文。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">有问题就从问题开始。答案、依据和下一步都放在眼前，不把读者赶去猜我的上下文。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">这些札记不预言答案，只记录问题怎样被拆开、依据从哪里来，以及下一次应该把火烧向哪里。</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">这些札记像旅途中摊开的地图：写下岔路、代价和当时没选的方向，下一次出发时就不必重新迷路。</span></p></header><div data-cstd-knowledge-list=\"true\" class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/14\"><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">你的双站架构怎么隔离？</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">个人主站和 RocoDex 共用一个 Next.js 部署，但域名、认证、内容模块和回归测试各自负责，互不越界。</p><a aria-label=\"阅读来源\" title=\"你的双站架构怎么隔离？ / 3 个关联节点\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/work/rocodex-platform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->2</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">AI 研究如何避免幻觉？</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。 公司研究最贵的往往不是 token，而是过期事实、重复任务和说不清来路的结论。 把对话、生成和资料沉淀设计为可以回看、可以继续的个人工作流。 私有 AI 工作台与 Alpha 研究工具均已独立部署。</p><a aria-label=\"阅读来源\" title=\"AI 研究如何避免幻觉？ / 3 个关联节点\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->3</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">DCF 为什么不用模型计算？</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">一次 DCF 扫描的性能复盘：热点不在公式，而在缓存 JSON 被反复搬运。 在课程与独立研究中，用计算和可视化把假设、数据与判断拆开。 方法来自数据科学、交互分析与量化研究实践。</p><a aria-label=\"阅读来源\" title=\"DCF 为什么不用模型计算？ / 3 个关联节点\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/notes/observable-dcf-pipeline\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->4</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">147 万行开放数据怎么变成可分析？</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">FIT5147 数据探索项目：清洗、空间连接并建模墨尔本 CBD 的行人与微气候数据，产出可一键重跑的分析管线。 把墨尔本 CBD 三个官方开放数据源清洗、空间连接并建模成一条可复现的分析管线：147 万行行人记录，在 150 米匹配规则下遇见微气候。 数据清洗并不只是分析前的杂活：每个缺失值、日期和主体匹配规则，都会改变产品怎么说话。</p><a aria-label=\"阅读来源\" title=\"147 万行开放数据怎么变成可分析？ / 2 个关联节点\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-cstd-content-health=\"true\" data-cstd-content-health-score=\"100\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#7f8b90]\">CONTENT HEALTH / <span class=\"text-white\">100</span></span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><a class=\"text-[#f4d431] hover:text-white\" href=\"/notes\">全部札记</a><a class=\"text-[#aeb8bb] hover:text-white\" href=\"/map\">知识图谱</a><a class=\"text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\" href=\"/graph.json\">GRAPH.JSON</a></div></div></div></section></div><footer id=\"cstd-footer\" data-cstd-finale=\"true\" data-cstd-scene=\"finale\" data-cstd-generated-visual=\"departure-city-v1\" class=\"relative z-20 min-h-[76svh] border-t border-[#f4d431]/30 text-[#f2efe7]\"><div class=\"relative flex min-h-[76svh] items-end overflow-hidden px-5 pb-12 pt-28 md:px-10 md:pb-16 lg:px-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.8)_48%,rgba(5,7,9,0.22)_88%)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(0deg,#050709_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.28)_38%,transparent_76%)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-[#f4d431]/60\"></div><div data-cstd-finale-layout=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1320px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_21rem] lg:items-end lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">05 / FINAL TRANSMISSION</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">05 / FINAL TRANSMISSION</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">终章 / 再赴人间</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">终章 / 营火仍明</span></p><h2 class=\"cstd-finale-title mt-8 text-5xl font-black leading-[0.9] tracking-[0] md:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">仍在<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">构建。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">仍在<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">构建。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">炉火未熄<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">继续锻造。</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">营火还亮着<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">下一段旅程继续写。</span></span></h2><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-[#cbd3d5] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">适合一起拆边界、写实现、做发布验收。<!-- --> <!-- -->每条能力仍在继续向前连接。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span data-cstd-final-tone=\"product\" class=\"cstd-final-capability flex items-center gap-2\"><span