t research jobs\"},\"inputMin\":2,\"inputMax\":8,\"inputStep\":1,\"inputDefault\":4,\"unit\":{\"zh\":\"个\",\"en\":\" jobs\"},\"sourceHref\":{\"zh\":\"/work/alpha-research-system\",\"en\":\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\"}},\"locale\":\"zh\"}]]}]]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/work/rocodex-platform\",\"aria-label\":\"阅读来源\",\"title\":\"你的双站架构怎么隔离？ / 3 个关联节点\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$f:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"article\",\"AI 研究如何避免幻觉？\",{\"data-cstd-knowledge-card\":true,\"className\":\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"sr-only\",\"children\":\"SOURCE LINKED\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":[\"0\",2]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"AI 研究如何避免幻觉？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\",\"children\":\"把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。 公司研究最贵的往往不是 token，而是过期事实、重复任务和说不清来路的结论。 把对话、生成和资料沉淀设计为可以回看、可以继续的个人工作流。 私有 AI 工作台与 Alpha 研究工具均已独立部署。\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/work/alpha-research-system\",\"aria-label\":\"阅读来源\",\"title\":\"AI 研究如何避免幻觉？ / 3 个关联节点\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$f:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"article\",\"DCF 为什么不用模型计算？\",{\"data-cstd-knowledge-card\":true,\"className\":\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"sr-only\",\"children\":\"SOURCE LINKED\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":[\"0\",3]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"DCF 为什么不用模型计算？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\",\"children\":\"一次 DCF 扫描的性能复盘：热点不在公式，而在缓存 JSON 被反复搬运。 在课程与独立研究中，用计算和可视化把假设、数据与判断拆开。 方法来自数据科学、交互分析与量化研究实践。\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/notes/observable-dcf-pipeline\",\"aria-label\":\"阅读来源\",\"title\":\"DCF 为什么不用模型计算？ / 3 个关联节点\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$f:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"article\",\"147 万行开放数据怎么变成可分析？\",{\"data-cstd-knowledge-card\":true,\"className\":\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"sr-only\",\"children\":\"SOURCE LINKED\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":[\"0\",4]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"147 万行开放数据怎么变成可分析？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\",\"children\":\"FIT5147 数据探索项目：清洗、空间连接并建模墨尔本 CBD 的行人与微气候数据，产出可一键重跑的分析管线。 把墨尔本 CBD 三个官方开放数据源清洗、空间连接并建模成一条可复现的分析管线：147 万行行人记录，在 150 米匹配规则下遇见微气候。 数据清洗并不只是分析前的杂活：每个缺失值、日期和主体匹配规则，都会改变产品怎么说话。\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\",\"aria-label\":\"阅读来源\",\"title\":\"147 万行开放数据怎么变成可分析？ / 2 个关联节点\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$f:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6\",\"data-cstd-content-health\":true,\"data-cstd-content-health-score\":100,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#7f8b90]\",\"children\":[\"CONTENT HEALTH / \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":100}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/notes\",\"className\":\"text-[#f4d431] hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"全部札记\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/map\",\"className\":\"text-[#aeb8bb] hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"知识图谱\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"href\":\"/graph.json\",\"className\":\"text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"GRAPH.JSON\"}